 of an observation $x$ is defined by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{x-\\overset{―}{x}}{\\sigma }.\n$$\n\nThe $z$-score represents how many standard deviations an observation is above or below the mean of the data set. Rewriting this in terms of $\\sigma ,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\sigma =\\frac{x-\\overset{―}{x}}{z}.\n$$\n\nSo, the standard deviation $\\sigma$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sigma  & =\\frac{x-\\overset{¯}{x}}{z} \\\\  & =\\frac{15-20.71}{-1.5} \\\\  & =3.81\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nto $2$ decimal places."] ["question-543c2585-7af9-533a-a269-b37c45eeb579" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-df0001ec-e44a-52b2-ad04-aa3230b4f04d" :answer-field/id #uuid "df0001ec-e44a-52b2-ad04-aa3230b4f04d"] ["answer-dc6c033b-6092-5094-8efd-03c857a491a2" :answer/id #uuid "dc6c033b-6092-5094-8efd-03c857a491a2"] ["answer-dc6c033b-6092-5094-8efd-03c857a491a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dc6c033b-6092-5094-8efd-03c857a491a2" :answer/value "-2.56"] ["answer-d87a2113-3ca9-5e90-9173-5ef22a26472f" :answer/id #uuid "d87a2113-3ca9-5e90-9173-5ef22a26472f"] ["answer-d87a2113-3ca9-5e90-9173-5ef22a26472f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d87a2113-3ca9-5e90-9173-5ef22a26472f" :answer/value "-3.81"] ["answer-b75010ed-05a2-5fae-94e7-e38cb062d94a" :answer/id #uuid "b75010ed-05a2-5fae-94e7-e38cb062d94a"] ["answer-b75010ed-05a2-5fae-94e7-e38cb062d94a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b75010ed-05a2-5fae-94e7-e38cb062d94a" :answer/value "0.26"] ["answer-526b6aa7-3f19-53ef-a532-7f9286139f53" :answer/id #uuid "526b6aa7-3f19-53ef-a532-7f9286139f53"] ["answer-526b6aa7-3f19-53ef-a532-7f9286139f53" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-526b6aa7-3f19-53ef-a532-7f9286139f53" :answer/value "2.81"] ["answer-3ad868d2-4b59-59e5-af41-cdcaa965a99b" :answer/id #uuid "3ad868d2-4b59-59e5-af41-cdcaa965a99b"] ["answer-3ad868d2-4b59-59e5-af41-cdcaa965a99b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3ad868d2-4b59-59e5-af41-cdcaa965a99b" :answer/value "3.81"] ["answer-fi